        {
          "text": " that will allow me to climb it for a short duration. \n\nI'm able to effortlessly maintain the ladder as long as I or any other person is close to it, But otherwise it will fade after twenty seconds."
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nIf I cast this spell on a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Metal Ritual Rune",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the effect will become permanent at that location, until broken manually."
        }
      ]
    }
